, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778607301, "id": "25843453205331519", "version": "6.6.400", "version_code": 10826, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25840926835584156"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778600474, "id": "25842336802109826", "version": "6.6.400", "version_code": 10824, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25840926835584156"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "395453121030677"}]}, "change_log": "General\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Imported meshes now edit panel display their names in the edit panel if they have one\n- Improved the performance of subdivision objects\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Fixed Recalculate Centre not working properly on OBJ imports\n\nVR\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Reworked Spatial Alignments\n    - Moved it into a tab in the Environments menu\n    - Multiple alignments can be created and co-exist in the same Room\n    - Alignments can be renamed and deleted\n    - Added the ability to create alignments via QR code\n    - Added virtual objects which represent alignments in the Room which can be moved, joined or deleted\n- Updated the look of the lock icon used in various parts of the app\n- If Grid is enabled its spacing will be used as the snapping increment for object movement performed with the gumball\n- Control points no longer snap to the Grid when moved via the gumball\n- The gumball pivot can now be snapped to Grid points\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Placing more than one customizable subdivision primitive no longer causes the customization sliders to become ungrabbable\n- Fixed other users\u2019 menus sometimes appearing to render on top of one and another if they closed a detached menu\n- A manually moved gumball no longer moves back to its default position after performing any gumball movement operation\n\nScreen App\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Added a selection menu. This allows you to toggle various option such as bounding box visibility, gumball orientation and whether groups are respected or ignored\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Fixed measurement objects, thicken surface UI and section views sometimes appearing much larger or smaller than intended", "created_date": 1778591802, "id": "25840926835584156", "version": "6.6.400", "version_code": 10823, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25840926835584156"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1778587504, "id": "25840266432316863", "version": "6.6.400", "version_code": 10